        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nRAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this stunning three-bedroom, Mid terrace family home in the ever popular and sought-after location of Wellmount Park in Finglas, Dublin 11.\nWellmount Park is situated close to Finglas Village and is sure to interest those who are seeking a superbly located home. The property enjoys an exceptional location, with local amenities and excellent transport routes on your doorstep. These include Finglas Village, Erin's Isle GAA, excellent primary and secondary schools, parks and DCU is within easy reach. Additionally, the Charlestown Shopping Centre and IKEA are situated nearby. The M50, N2, N3, M1, Excellent bus routes and Dublin Airport are all easily accessible, making this an ideal location for commuters.\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation of c. 85 sqm comprises of an inviting entrance hallway, spacious living room, fully fitted modern kitchen and dining area with utility area and newly refurbished modern bathroom extension.\nThis stunning home is presented in turn key condition throughout being recently rewired and replumbed, new double-glazed windows throughout, new floors and doors throughout and gas fired central heating with a new gas boiler.\nThe properties new owner will have the opportunity to lay down roots in one of Dublin 11s most sought after and family-oriented locations. An opportunity not to be missed; Contact the agent at our Northside office on 01-6995050 or 086-0469458 for further information or to arrange viewing!!\n\n\nAdditional Features:\n\n<ul>\n <li>c. 85 sq.m</li>\n <li>Three Bedrooms | One Bathroom</li>\n <li>Mid Terrace</li>\n <li>BER F</li>\n <li>Extended to rear</li>\n <li>Block built shed to rear</li>\n <li>Turn key condition</li>\n <li>Rewired and replumbed</li>\n <li>Gas-fired central heating with new gas boiler</li>\n <li>New Double-glazed windows throughout</li>\n <li>New Quality flooring throughout</li>\n <li>Refurbished throughout</li>\n <li>Mature and highly sought-after location</li>\n <li>Excellent primary, secondary schools and DCU closeby</li>\n <li>Walking distance to local shops and amenities</li>\n <li>Close to Glasnevin & Finglas Village</li>\n <li>Close to Charlestown Shopping Centre, Clearwater Shopping Centre and IKEA</li>\n <li>Excellent public transport links nearby</li>\n <li>Easy access to the M50 & N2 motorway</li>\n <li>Only 15 minutes' drive to Dublin Airport</li>\n <li>Easy access to Dublin City Centre</li>\n <li>Superb family home</li>\n <li>Early viewing highly advised!!</li>\n</ul>"
      },
      {
